    "gp_section_642945971046580850": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "a7ed986206884948b27f72e0bcb2b1881ce7e975d486d0a35791f9ac65624053_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggAd7XsHFDX_text": "<p>The Science Behind Gut Health</p>",
        "ggID5IQOU3d_text": "<p>Your digestive system is home to trillions of bacteria that influence digestion, energy, immunity, and even mood.</p><p>When your gut is out of balance, it can affect how you process food, absorb nutrients, and respond to stress.</p><p>Supporting your gut daily helps restore balance, improve digestion, and keep your body functioning at its best.</p>",
        "ggIfkfT5-Mv_text": "Your gut impacts everything your Body feel",
        "ggJ_KoVRP4e_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0946/3011/7697/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_78u0ju78u0ju78u0_3.png",
        "gghKxRC1sg2_label": "<p>Learn More</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-642945971046580850"
    },
    "gp_section_642945971080135671": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "d25f10b904b36ebd43d274215958bfcffbc80de9b636958d877b65ef943fb0b6_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg2i_KO8Hvy_text": "Targeted Daily Formula",
        "ggK6_iZBA8t_text": "Science-Backed Support",
        "ggQqwnmN1a3_text": "<p>Designed for real-life routines—works effectively even with stress, irregular meals, and busy lifestyles.</p>",
        "ggS2HDkM7R7_text": "No Artificial Additives",
        "ggWv2o5qJZW_text": "<p>Made with natural fibers, probiotics, and botanical extractsto support your body the natural way.</p>",
        "ggcLe-VBFuh_text": "<p>Free from unnecessary fillers, artificial colors, and synthetic ingredients—just what your gut truly needs.</p>",
        "gggNLca_E0A_text": "Plant-Based &amp; Gut-Friendly",
        "ggqFWJabaEN_text": "Gentle on Your System",
        "gguvzzcZmvG_text": "<p>Formulated based on modern gut microbiome research to support digestion and long-term gut health.</p>",
        "ggvWmxYAIB__text": "<p>Non-habit forming and easy on the stomach, suitable for daily use without harsh effects.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-642945971080135671"
    },
    "gp_section_642945971432456818": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "a51578fd91f701fe32b6603ca86d8f3693f9ea64fe98fe8699e0224b03c1c096_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg4BPcGcAE-_text": "<p>Most probiotics only focus on adding good bacteria. GemGut goes further by combining probiotics, digestive enzymes, and soothing extracts to support both immediate relief and long-term gut health.</p>",
        "gg55veKo_hY_text": "<p>Many users notice reduced bloating and discomfort within 30–60 minutes, with more stable digestion over consistent use.</p>",
        "gg8M3WyVNMg_text": "<p>Need more answers about all our products?</p>",
        "gg8Rm7AZtUd_label": "<p><u>Check all product FAQs</u></p>",
        "ggNEj4B5uFJ_text": "<p>Take 1–2 servings daily, preferably after meals. No preparation needed — designed for convenience.</p>",
        "ggOf6bZEhKO_childItem_0": "<p>What is GemGut?</p>",
        "ggOf6bZEhKO_childItem_1": "<p>How is GemGut different from other probiotics?</p>",
        "ggOf6bZEhKO_childItem_2": "<p>How do I take GemGut?</p>",
        "ggOf6bZEhKO_childItem_3": "<p>When will I feel results?</p>",
        "ggOf6bZEhKO_childItem_4": "<p>Is GemGut safe for daily use?</p>",
        "ggOf6bZEhKO_childItem_5": "<p>Can I take GemGut with other supplements?</p>",
        "ggVD0-KODzf_text": "Frequently Asked Questions",
        "gg_Idvwa9Zy_text": "<p>Or drop us an email.</p>",
        "ggaEh6p6QMd_text": "<p>GemGut is a daily gut health supplement designed to support digestion, reduce bloating, and improve gut balance — especially for people dealing with stress-related digestive issues.</p>",
        "ggdIfsiW9mO_text": "<p>In most cases, yes. However, if you’re on medication or have specific conditions, consult your healthcare provider. For best results, consistent daily use helps maintain a balanced gut microbiome and prevent recurring issues.</p>",
        "ggeEkPVn-7c_label": "<p><u>Contact us</u></p>",
        "gginlsZ15Li_text": "<p>Any purchase or account related information you can find in support articles.</p>",
        "ggnLISHN7oz_label": "<p><u>Help Center</u></p>",
        "ggowdtGS-B3_text": "<p>Yes. GemGut is non-habit forming and designed to be part of your daily routine.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-642945971432456818"
    },
