    "gp_section_642945971499565681": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "d938f44962519bda67cae35fbaeeac36a67afeddb87a61ba9e8a7ed46dd9c1ed_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg0JWpHAK0Z_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0946/3011/7697/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_78u0ju78u0ju78u0_1.png",
        "gg9Jjo8iK_k_text": "We reintroduce beneficial bacteria",
        "ggLRy2r3xmE_text": "We start by calming gut disruption",
        "ggLtGupNIMP_text": "<p>GemGut is a natural, multi-action formula designed to support your digestive system in real-life conditions—stress, irregular eating, and modern lifestyles. Instead of forcing quick fixes, it works with your body to gently reset, rebalance, and strengthen your gut over time.</p>",
        "ggPe4IFMO-C_text": "<p>3</p>",
        "ggSAPKmYg9S_text": "<p>4</p>",
        "ggSfX8Euaw0_text": "<p>With consistent use, your gut becomes more stable, better at handling stress, and more efficient at absorbing nutrients—helping you feel lighter, more energized, and in control every day.</p>",
        "ggY8BVKIUkg_text": "<p>1</p>",
        "ggZhgT3pHrM_text": "<p>With the gut environment improved, live probiotic cultures (Lactobacillus &amp; Bifidobacterium) are able to settle and begin restoring a healthy microbiome.</p>",
        "gg_DbALGREo_text": "Your digestion starts working efficiently again",
        "ggbBsaOwpML_text": "Then we reduce harmful bacteria",
        "ggdeCx1bD_m_text": "Here’s how it works",
        "ggfR1tG16YS_text": "<p>5</p>",
        "ggj1A4yJybj_text": "Your gut stays balanced and resilient",
        "ggkzsQP-6cI_text": "<p>Your gut is constantly affected by daily stress, кофе, fast food, and irregular eating habits. These factors can irritate your digestive system, leading to bloating, discomfort, and sluggish digestion.</p><p>GemGut begins with soothing botanical extracts like ginger, chamomile, and aloe vera to calm inflammation and relax the digestive tract. This creates a more stable internal environment—an essential first step before any real gut repair can happen.</p>",
        "ggpykt7jeL6_text": "<p>An imbalanced gut often means harmful bacteria have started to dominate. Instead of harsh elimination, GemGut uses natural prebiotic fibers to gently shift the ecosystem.</p><p>These fibers act as nourishment for beneficial bacteria while making it harder for harmful microbes to thrive. Over time, this helps rebalance your gut in a sustainable, non-aggressive way—without disrupting your body’s natural rhythm.</p>",
        "ggxAxXA16EV_text": "<p>Plant-based enzymes and peppermint support faster breakdown of food, reducing bloating, heaviness, and post-meal discomfort—often within 30–60 minutes.</p>",
        "ggyJo6HucdM_text": "<p>2</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-642945971499565681"
    },
    "gp_section_642945971499566023": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "b4c98efc9d1c092e40315c128a38fda63332da7e7f4a1dd298cbcc8b52e58bec_1_1_1_0__1",
