        "gg5_ywSysHp_text": "<p>Be the first to experience new formulas, improvements, and product launches. Subscribers get priority access so you’re always one step ahead.</p>",
        "gg7N0uMxXqM_text": "Exclusive samples",
        "ggHN5YQgUZF_text": "<p>Stay consistent and get rewarded. Receive special gifts on milestone deliveries as a thank-you for making your health a priority.</p>",
        "ggWIcH8qjDx_text": "Bonus gifts along the way",
        "ggXC1_TUZJH_text": "Save on every order",
        "ggZ2gAP7Vxp_text": "Free shipping, always",
        "ggZkV79WK4y_text": "Earn rewards as you go",
        "gg_OJFERFxU_text": "<p>Your GemGut is delivered straight to your door at no extra cost, so you can focus on building a healthy routine without hidden expenses.</p>",
        "ggb5kGsdeR7_text": "<p>When you subscribe, you unlock exclusive pricing that makes it easier to stay consistent. No need to reorder every time.</p>",
        "ggtj-UBvxLM_text": "<p>Every order brings you closer to rewards. Collect points with each purchase and redeem them for discounts, products, or exclusive perks.</p>",
        "gguR9iMRu4h_text": "Early access to new releases",
        "ggvY0_p62A8_text": "<p>Try new products and variations before they officially launch. It’s a simple way to explore what works best for your body.</p>"
      },
